            AssessedProvenance.FromRepo(), Blocks(Paragraph(Text("Translate a pointwise convex decomposition into membership of an openSegment in the real vector space of continuous linear functionals. In the forward direction, Mathlib's mem_extremePoints equates the endpoint functionals and State.toContinuousLinearMap_injective equates their states. Conversely write the positive segment coefficients as t and 1-t, apply State.IsExtremePoint, and use their sum being 1 to identify both endpoints with omega."))), DescribeRole.Theorem),
